{{also|jit|JIT}}
==Czech==
===Pronunciation===
*{{audio|Cs-jít.ogg|audio}}

===Verb===
{{cs-verb|a=i}}

# to [[walk]], [[go]] {{gloss|on foot}}
# to [[work]], [[do]], [[suffice]]
#: ''Budou tři stačit? - To '''půjde'''.'' - Will three be enough? - It'll do.
#: '''''Jde''' mi to.'' - ''I'm good at this.'' (literally ''(It) works for me.'')
# to be possible
#: '''''Nejde''' udělat všechno dobře, ale udělat většinu udělat dobře by už mohlo '''jít'''.''
# with the conjunction '''o''': to [[concern]], [[matter]], [[interest]] {{gloss|to be at issue, to be at stake}}
#: '''''Jde o''' život.'' -- ''There's a life at stake.'' (literally ''A life is concerned.'')
#: ''Právě '''o''' to mi '''jde'''.'' -- ''That's exactly what I'm concerned about.''

